poetry:l4-y3@claude-opus-5-5.text:
Ghosts sigh in rain;
birds left the tree;
summer sang,
now sings no more.

poetry:l3-y4@claude-opus-5-5.text:
Lost loves sigh in rain;
the boughs fall still;
summer sings no more.

poetry:l5-y2@claude-opus-5-5.text:
I forget;
ghosts sigh;
boughs hush;
summer sang,
sings no more.

poetry:haiku@gpt-6-luna.text:
Ghosts in rain tap glass—
